  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>For the given compounds:&nbsp;</p><p>(1)&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/e263173d-909f-477b-90bc-ec1bd25df1b2-image.png\" style=\"width: 183px; height: 65px;\" />;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>.</mo></math> on Nitrogen is&nbsp;delocalised.</p><p>(2)&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/073a483b-cd08-4eec-a6c0-8d8df26cf8f6-d6f62aed-92db-4e8a-acb0-2f592075a93c-image.png\" style=\"width: 211px; height: 73px;\" />;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>.</mo></math> on Nitrogen is&nbsp;localised.</p><p>(3)&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/4ddce132-6826-4d9a-a456-4695dd073efb-image.png\" style=\"width: 211px; height: 68px;\" />;&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>.</mo></math> on Nitrogen is&nbsp;delocalised due to conjugation with both&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/998c953f-e3de-420e-98ee-1511086574cb-image.png\" style=\"width: 54px; height: 59px;\" />&nbsp;</p><p>(Hence least basic)</p><p>(4) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>&#168;</mo></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>.</mo></math> on Nitrogen&nbsp;is localised.</p>",
